                                "sense_id": "b52a4708-2134-360a-a3ad-a62a7c3e09f1",
                                "text": "“This is Tris Prior. Her brother, Caleb. And their friend Susan Black.” “Prior,” she says. “I know of several Priors, but none of them are named Tris. Beatrice, however...\""
