                                "sense_id": "b52a4708-2134-360a-a3ad-a62a7c3e09f1",
                                "text": "I said, 'Are you Isabel or Tris?'",
                                "translation": "I'm Tris. Patricia.' She was back to her hair, eyes crammed to the side, snapping off dry split ends and flicking them to the floor.",
